    🔹 Important: Dev vs Production
    Development (your current setup)
    Using self-signed keystore → browser warning is normal ✅
    You can safely click Advanced → Proceed
    HTTPS is still working; traffic is encrypted

    Production (real users)
    Do NOT use self-signed certs
    You must get a certificate from a trusted CA (Let’s Encrypt, DigiCert, etc.)
    Then put it in your keystore (.p12 or .jks)
    Browsers will not show warnings for users



